<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tpl_app_exit">TplAppExit</link></para>

<para>This class provides methods to handle the exit action within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It includes functionalities to process the exit action and generate the necessary action strings. </para>
